.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt SSL_GET_FD 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm SSL_get_fd ,
.Nm SSL_get_rfd ,
.Nm SSL_get_wfd
.Nd get file descriptor linked to an SSL object
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/ssl.h
.Ft int
.Fo SSL_get_fd
.Fa "const SSL *ssl"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo SSL_get_rfd
.Fa "const SSL *ssl"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo SSL_get_wfd
.Fa "const SSL *ssl"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn SSL_get_fd
returns the file descriptor which is linked to
.Fa ssl .
.Fn SSL_get_rfd
and
.Fn SSL_get_wfd
return the file descriptors for the read or the write channel, which can
be different.
If the read and the write channel are different,
.Fn SSL_get_fd
will return the file descriptor of the read channel.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
The following return values can occur:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It -1
The operation failed, because the underlying BIO is not of the correct
type (suitable for file descriptors).
.It \(ra=0
The file descriptor linked to
.Fa ssl .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr SSL_set_fd 3 ,
.Xr ssl 7
,
.Xr bio 7
